5,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I worry we focus on the pitch, not the daily friction. I want to see the actual losses.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,I am curious about the human cost. Who actually absorbs the extra workload when things go sideways?,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I am tired of promising dates based on hope. I need to know who controls the access we depend on.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I am concerned about the funding source. The budget line matters more than the pitch.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I keep seeing the same mistakes repeat. I want to check what actually happened to the last three internal rollouts.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
